press escape             ' Back closes the manual v1.2 opens on a new game's first world map (MapScene.cs:687-691)
mapclick 354,317          ' into the start location
wait 60
clickon 228              ' a man the leader's experience may hire (3/2 x 37 = 55)
hire                     ' paid with the meat
trade                    ' over to the trader
trade
trade
