uiclick 246,128          ' for the trader's first
deal
esc
wait 10
day
wait 10
day
wait 10
save                     ' the cut, day 3
wait 20
day
wait 10
day
wait 10
trade                    ' back to the trader, whose stock has turned over
trade
trade
